      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but my doctor said the first week would be rough and that i might have some swelling. it feels more like just being bloated and sore though. do you think i could just take some extra ibuprofen and maybe some tylenol together to see if it settles down by morning? i really dont want to deal with the ER wait right now if it isn't life or death.",
